{"reviewId": "254854030_88bqeK4dF", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 17, "content": "技术革命是经济增长的根本源头，但它不能直接变成全社会的真实增长，必须依靠房地产这个最核心的载体把增长落地，因为房地产能带动巨大的投资、需求和产业链。而大宗商品最主要的需求正是来自房地产和基建，房地产周期的强弱、启动与回落直接决定了商品产能什么时候扩张什么时候收缩，也就是说房地产周期是商品产能周期能够产生并运行的关键决定力量。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "我们认为，房地产周期是驱动商品周期的重要力量。从逻辑上看，康波增长除了作为技术革命的主导产业，现实增长的最核心载体就是房地产周期。这意味着，房地产周期是决定商品产能周期出现的重要因素。", "range": "11568-11660", "chapterName": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "chapterIdx": 17, "reviewId": "254854030_88bqeK4dF", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775542602, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "12 康波中的房地产周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 358320842, "name": "伟", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/cHZa5oyjCP0OcHuZ4Vh8vVFUZktGB9xbe6Cf5ZSicrHRjxtVT3lXV2VGL3sx1Q58I66ahMldMm5KsxvybDSvGww/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20260202-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": 